[BEGIN]
  ObjTp=Hd
  Cmn1=EtherGate Preset v1.0\\\\One preset for every Channel symbol on||1
  Cmn2=the selected EtherGate.\\The gateway does not store presets. This||1
  Cmn3=module does.\\\\Save stores the current percent of each Channel||1
  Cmn4=symbol on that slot.\\Recall fades those channels. Fade_Time is||1
  Cmn5=seconds on the symbol\\(0.5s is half a second, 0 is a cut). Fade_Time_Override||1
  Cmn6=is tenths\\of a second. It is ignored until an analog value arrives.
  Cmn7=||1After that,\\the analog is the fade, and 0 is a cut. 5 is 0.5 seconds.
  Cmn8=||150 is 5.0 seconds.\\\\Preset_Override is ignored until an analog||1
  Cmn9=value arrives. After that,\\1-16 selects that preset.\\\\Active_FB||1
  Cmn10=is high when this preset has been stored and every member\\channel||1
  Cmn11=is at its stored level. An empty preset does not recall.\\\\Controller_Override||1
  Cmn12=is ignored until an analog value arrives. After that,\\1-8 selects||1
  Cmn13=that slot.\\This symbol is notified only when this preset's active||1
  Cmn14=state changes.
[END]
